WEBVTT

00:00:06.323 --> 00:00:07.890
GUY: Um...
好 但这个没有咕噜的好听

00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:11.632
Okay. But it won't
be as good as Grug's.
好 但这个没有咕噜的好听

00:00:11.676 --> 00:00:13.112
[SCOFFS]

00:00:13.156 --> 00:00:15.288
[CLEARS THROAT]
Um...

00:00:15.332 --> 00:00:19.640
Once upon a time,
there was a beautiful tiger.
很久以前有一只美丽的老虎

00:00:19.684 --> 00:00:22.774
[GASPS]
She lived in a cave with
the rest of her family.
她和其他的家人一起住在洞穴里

00:00:22.818 --> 00:00:24.689
Her father and
mother told her,
她爸妈告诉她:

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.691
"You may go
anywhere you want...
「你想去哪里都可以」

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:30.390
"but never go near the cliff,
for you could fall."
「但是不要接近悬崖

00:00:30.434 --> 00:00:33.611
And die.
Good story.
然后死掉 很好的故事

00:00:33.654 --> 00:00:35.656
GUY: But when no one
was looking...
但是她趁没人注意的时候

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:40.270
she'd go near the cliff...
跑到悬崖附近

00:00:40.313 --> 00:00:42.359
for the closer
she came to the edge...
因为她越接近边缘

00:00:42.402 --> 00:00:45.928
the more she could hear,
the more she could see...
就听见越多的声音 看见越多的风景

00:00:45.971 --> 00:00:47.886
the more she could feel.
体会到越多的感受

00:00:50.106 --> 00:00:51.455
Finally...
最后

00:00:51.498 --> 00:00:54.806
she stood
at the very edge.
她站到了最边边的地方

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:56.721
She saw a light.
她看见一道光

00:00:56.765 --> 00:01:00.377
She leaned out
to touch it...
她往前倾想碰触光

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:01.813
and she slipped.
[ALL GASP]
结果她滑倒了

00:01:01.857 --> 00:01:03.380
And she fell.
然后她摔下去了

00:01:03.423 --> 00:01:05.469
And she flew.
结果飞起来了

00:01:05.512 --> 00:01:07.601
[ALL GASP]
她飞到哪里去了

00:01:07.645 --> 00:01:08.994
Where did she fly?
她飞到哪里去了

00:01:09.473 --> 00:01:10.779
Tomorrow.
明天

00:01:10.822 --> 00:01:12.345
Tomorrow?
明天

00:01:12.389 --> 00:01:15.087
A place with
more suns in the sky
than you can count.
那边的天空里有数不清的太阳

00:01:15.131 --> 00:01:16.654
It would be so bright.
那一定很亮

00:01:16.697 --> 00:01:19.570
A place not like today,
or yesterday.
那个地方不像今天或是昨天

00:01:19.613 --> 00:01:22.660
A place where
things are better.
在那里 什么都会比较好

00:01:22.703 --> 00:01:24.140
[ALL GASP]

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:25.881
Tomorrow isn't a place.
明天不是一个地方

00:01:25.924 --> 00:01:26.969
[STAMMERS]
明天不是一个地方

00:01:27.012 --> 00:01:28.492
You can't see it!
你看不见的

00:01:28.535 --> 00:01:30.450
Oh, yes, it is.
它是一个地方

00:01:31.103 --> 00:01:32.670
I've seen it.
我看过

00:01:32.713 --> 00:01:33.889
[ALL GASP]

00:01:35.368 --> 00:01:37.196
That's where I'm going.
那就是我们要去的地方

00:01:44.595 --> 00:01:46.510
Ooh...
我们要闭上眼睛睡觉了

00:01:46.553 --> 00:01:50.993
We are going to shut
our eyes and sleep.
我们要闭上眼睛睡觉了

00:01:51.036 --> 00:01:52.559
[GIGGLES]
And when we wake up...
等我们起床

00:01:52.603 --> 00:01:54.692
we're going to find
the place that has
everything we want.
有我们需要的一切的地方

00:01:54.735 --> 00:01:55.867
Tomorrow?
是「明天」吗

00:01:55.911 --> 00:01:57.173
A cave.
是「洞穴」

00:01:59.305 --> 00:02:00.393
[GASPS]

00:02:05.529 --> 00:02:06.878
[SNORING]

00:02:14.755 --> 00:02:17.019
[RUMBLING]

00:02:23.242 --> 00:02:24.374
[THUDS]

00:02:25.114 --> 00:02:26.245
[MUMBLES]

00:02:31.642 --> 00:02:32.643
[GASPS]

00:02:33.078 --> 00:02:34.297
[SCREAMS]

00:02:36.255 --> 00:02:38.214
That was too close.
It almost caught us.
真是惊险 我们差点被抓到了

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:40.172
I was watching.
We were fine.
我有在看 我们没事

00:02:40.216 --> 00:02:41.782
We gotta move faster.
我们动作要快一点了

00:02:41.826 --> 00:02:44.698
Do you people
have any other speed
aside from "wander"?
有别的速度吗

00:02:44.742 --> 00:02:46.918
I'll take a shamble
at this point.
我觉得现在还有「拖拖拉拉」

00:02:46.962 --> 00:02:48.920
Hey, um,
do you have a minute?
你有空吗

00:02:48.964 --> 00:02:50.922
How did the tiger fly?
那只老虎是怎么飞的

00:02:50.966 --> 00:02:53.490
I only share when
I'm outside the log.
我只有脱离树干的时候才会说

00:02:53.533 --> 00:02:54.970
I'm funny that way.
那时候我才有心情

00:02:55.013 --> 00:02:58.016
Leave this to me.
交给我吧

00:02:58.974 --> 00:03:00.366
Hey, Thunk...
坦克

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.325
you have a spider
on your face.
Ah!
你脸上有蜘蛛

00:03:03.456 --> 00:03:04.501
[GRUNTS]
糟糕

00:03:04.544 --> 00:03:05.981
Oops.
糟糕

00:03:06.024 --> 00:03:08.113
[GASPS]
He's loose!
他逃走了

00:03:08.157 --> 00:03:10.289
[CRUNCHES]
[GASPS]

00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:12.248
[YELLS]
不要踩那些尖尖的奇怪石头

00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:15.947
Do not step on those
weird pointy rocks.
不要踩那些尖尖的奇怪石头

00:03:15.991 --> 00:03:17.209
Do you mean
these rocks?
你是说这些吗

00:03:17.253 --> 00:03:18.297
Ow!
不要踩那些石头

00:03:18.341 --> 00:03:20.299
Do not step
on these rocks!
不要踩那些石头

00:03:20.343 --> 00:03:22.084
Step aside, girls.
站到旁边去 娘娘腔

00:03:22.127 --> 00:03:24.390
Mmm!
[SCREAMS]
我是怎么说的 没有人听我讲

00:03:24.434 --> 00:03:27.480
Hello?
Nobody's listening!
No one is listening.
我是怎么说的 没有人听我讲

00:03:27.524 --> 00:03:30.396
You cannot walk on those!
你们不能踩在上面

00:03:34.531 --> 00:03:35.706
[GRUNTS]

00:03:40.406 --> 00:03:41.755
[SPEAKS GIBBERISH]

00:03:43.279 --> 00:03:44.976
Get back here now!
马上回来这里

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:47.892
There goes
our chance for survival.
我们生存的机会跑了

00:03:47.936 --> 00:03:49.720
And our log!
还有我们的树干

00:03:50.721 --> 00:03:51.765
Okay.
好吧

00:03:52.592 --> 00:03:54.159
[GROANING]

00:03:55.334 --> 00:03:56.640
[CHUCKLING]

00:04:02.602 --> 00:04:04.387
Ow! Ow, ow.

00:04:08.347 --> 00:04:10.132
THUNK: Ow! Ah! Ow!

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:15.006
Jumping doesn't help.
It does briefly...
用跳的没有用 刚开始好像可以

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:16.529
but it doesn't
get better.
[SHRIEKS]
但其实一样痛

00:04:16.573 --> 00:04:17.878
[ALL GROANING]

00:04:18.444 --> 00:04:20.011
How about--
那么...

00:04:20.055 --> 00:04:22.448
Don't walk on your hands.
The hands do
not help at all.
不要用手走 手没有帮助

00:04:23.536 --> 00:04:25.190
[ALL CONTINUE GROANING]

00:04:30.021 --> 00:04:31.457
Come on.
走吧

00:04:33.416 --> 00:04:34.939
I can help you...
我可以帮你们

00:04:34.983 --> 00:04:37.594
but we're going to have
to make a few changes
around here.
但我们要改变几件事

00:04:37.637 --> 00:04:39.770
The log ride is over.
不准再把我放在树干里

00:04:39.813 --> 00:04:41.076
Drop the log.
把树干丢掉

00:04:45.515 --> 00:04:47.473
Now, kick it away.
现在把它踢走

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.043
Farther.
踢远一点

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:54.959
[GRUNTS]

00:04:56.787 --> 00:04:57.962
Really?
需要这样吗

00:04:58.702 --> 00:05:02.010
Okay, smart "Guy"...
好吧 「盖」聪明的家伙

00:05:02.053 --> 00:05:03.315
now what?
然后呢

00:05:06.753 --> 00:05:08.059
[COOING]

00:05:11.019 --> 00:05:13.021
Whoa! Oh...
Whoa, whoa, whoa...

00:05:13.847 --> 00:05:15.066
[WHIMPERING]

00:05:17.982 --> 00:05:20.071
Good fish, good fish.
乖鱼 乖鱼

00:05:20.115 --> 00:05:21.638
Oh! [PANTING]

00:05:22.247 --> 00:05:23.509
[GIGGLES]
好 现在可以看了

00:05:23.553 --> 00:05:26.121
Okay.
Now you can look.
好 现在可以看了

00:05:28.819 --> 00:05:30.386
[SCREAMS]
我超爱的 我的脚呢

00:05:30.429 --> 00:05:33.084
I love them!
Where are my feet?
我超爱的 我的脚呢

00:05:33.128 --> 00:05:34.303
They're still there!
还在这里

00:05:34.346 --> 00:05:35.391
[GASPING]
好

00:05:35.434 --> 00:05:36.827
Okay.
好

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:38.742
Whoa, whoa!
你真的很重

00:05:38.785 --> 00:05:40.178
[GRUNTS]
You're really heavy.
你真的很重

00:05:40.222 --> 00:05:41.440
Really?
真的吗

00:05:41.484 --> 00:05:42.659
Thank you!
谢谢称赞

00:05:43.703 --> 00:05:45.357
Hey. Wait!
你们搞什么

00:05:45.401 --> 00:05:46.793
Whoa. Whoa!

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:48.665
Whoa!
没事

00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:50.101
Oh! Okay.
没事

00:05:50.145 --> 00:05:51.972
She's up. We're good.
I'm good.
她站好了 我们没事 我没事

00:05:52.016 --> 00:05:53.757
Oh, these shoes
are great!
这些鞋子真棒

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:55.672
Where do you get
these ideas?
你怎么会有这些点子

00:05:55.715 --> 00:05:56.803
A-ha!

00:05:59.632 --> 00:06:01.895
I'm calling it
a "brain."
我会说是「用脑袋」

00:06:01.939 --> 00:06:04.289
I'm pretty sure
it's where ideas
come from.
我很确定点子都是从这里来的

00:06:04.333 --> 00:06:07.640
Dad,
I don't have a brain.
老爸 我没有脑袋

00:06:07.684 --> 00:06:10.991
We've gotten along
just fine without
brains until now.
我们没有脑袋也好好活到现在了

00:06:11.035 --> 00:06:14.169
Cavemen don't
need brains.
We have these.
原始人不需要脑袋 我们有这个

00:06:14.212 --> 00:06:15.257
[LAUGHING]
就是这样 逊咖才需要点子

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:16.823
That's what
I'm talking about!
就是这样 逊咖才需要点子

00:06:16.867 --> 00:06:18.782
Ideas are for weaklings.
就是这样 逊咖才需要点子

00:06:18.825 --> 00:06:21.045
Now, let's get
to that mountain!
现在我们去那座山吧

00:06:24.179 --> 00:06:26.529
Oh, wow!
I love those!
哇 我爱脚上的这个东西

00:06:26.572 --> 00:06:28.792
Good fish.
Don't eat my feet.
乖鱼 不要把我的脚吃掉

00:06:28.835 --> 00:06:29.836
[WHIMPERS]

00:06:31.186 --> 00:06:32.317
Huh!

00:06:34.232 --> 00:06:35.233
[GROWLS]

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:37.366
[GROWLS]

00:06:37.409 --> 00:06:38.628
[CHITTERS]

00:06:38.671 --> 00:06:40.151
[ALL CHITTERING EXCITEDLY]

